      "body": "Fixes #7322. Queue task 14265 (lane code-f).\n\n## What\n- New dedicated basic-tier workflow `.github/workflows/deploy-flake-checks.yml`: on `pull_request` touching `pkgs/deploy/**`, `lib/default.nix`, or the workflow itself, it builds exactly `checks.x86_64-linux.deploy-list` and `checks.x86_64-linux.deploy-list-malformed` — job name `basic: deploy flake checks (deploy-list + deploy-list-malformed)`. Modeled on `proxy-port-fallbacks.yml`; targeted build of two runCommandLocal checks, never a full flake check on a PR.\n- `.github/ci-policy.md`: new Deploy flake checks section + tier-table row naming the check in the merge-gate story.\n- `.github/test-suite-registry.json`: new `deploy.flake-checks` suite entry (mapped, venue = the new workflow).\n\n## Deviation from the triage packet\nThe packet suggested `pull_request + merge_group`, modeled on proxy-port-fallbacks.yml. Current ci-policy.md records Drew's 2026-11-08 no-merge-queue ruling: merge_group triggers were removed fleet-wide and proxy-port-fallbacks.yml is pull_request-only today. This workflow follows current policy (pull_request only).\n\n## Test / oracle\nThis PR touches the workflow path itself, so it is its own probe PR: the `basic: deploy flake checks (deploy-list + deploy-list-malformed)` check run must appear and its log must name and build both checks. Workflow YAML validated with yq; workflow-lint CI validates the workflow set.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796793689&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7964&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7964&signature=28bf0f3528a053deea1e731c6ac165d6a2fdc356a668976faa9002bd7186c154\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7964?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
